Package: OpenBE
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Bioequivalence Analysis Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Frederico", "Martins", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "fredseverinomartins@gmail.com")
Description: Traceable research workflows for conventional and replicate
    bioequivalence, experimental parallel and Williams crossover analyses,
    noncompartmental pharmacokinetics and study planning. Established engines
    perform statistical calculations. Regulatory eligibility is evaluated
    separately and is never inferred from computational success.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: BE (>= 0.3.0), replicateBE (>= 1.1.3), PowerTOST (>= 1.5.7),
    PKNCA (>= 0.12.1), nlme, emmeans, ggplot2, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, quarto, renv, roxygen2,
    pkgdown, dplyr, tidyr, readr, readxl, lme4, lmerTest
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/fredsevmartins/OpenBE
BugReports: https://github.com/fredsevmartins/OpenBE/issues
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
